/* used[0]=0 (a guaranteed empty/transparent raw tile) is deliberately
   reserved at position 0: the b_idx==0 fallback ("no B overlay") resolves
   through remap[0]. Without the reservation the first REAL tile of the
   segment ends up there instead of transparency - which once made every
   wilt tile draw a wrong overlay and, through terrain_solid, block the
   corridor as well. */
